# 6.1 Touring the builtins
# Beats: list the bundled workflows, then walk the picker so each entry and its
# description is read in turn.
# An earlier take sat on one static picker screen and encoded as a near-still,
# so this take keeps the selection moving and ends on a launched run.
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Type "atomic"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 12s
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Type "/workflow list"
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 12s
Type "/workflow"
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 3s
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Up
Sleep 1.2s
Up
Sleep 1.2s
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Down
Sleep 1.5s
Escape
Sleep 2s
Set TypingSpeed 28ms
Type "Which bundled workflow should I use to independently prove a change is correct, and why?"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 30s
